{"type":"message","id":"95773b2c","parentId":"ec45a4c5","timestamp":"2026-04-13T19:02:30.647Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-04-13 19:02 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: System (untrusted): [2026-04-11 05:02:19 UTC] Exec completed (lucky-bi, code 1) :: Config invalid File: ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json Problem: - agents.defaults: Unrecognized key: \"***\" Run: openclaw doctor --fix Gateway aborted: config is invalid. agents.defau… System (untrust\n- Assistant: Hey. Just came online. Looks like a fresh start — no memory files, no history, just the open road. I'm running on kimi-k2.5 (same as the default). So — who are you? And what are we doing today?\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52a982145ca0ee7ada33d646c19\", \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-11 05:31 UTC\" } ``` Sender (untrusted metada\n- Assistant: 我看到你的配置里已经有 `plugins.entries.volcengine.config.memory-core.config.dreaming` 的配置了，但目前是注释掉的。而且有个错误显示 `agents.defaults` 里有不识别的 `dreaming` key。 你具体想怎么配置梦境功能？是： 1. **启用梦境回顾** - 定时总结记忆，生成\"梦境\" 2. **调整频率** - 改成每天几点运行 3. **修复配置错误** - 删除 `agents.defaults` 里错误的 `dreaming` key 告诉我\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"message_id\": \"om_x100b529669eb9ca4ee88f2ee05f48f4\", \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-04-11 10:29 UTC\" } ``` Sender (untrusted metada\n- Assistant: 这是你的定时任务（cron job）执行超时了。 **\"节点异常检测\"** 这个定时任务在运行过程中超过了设定的最大执行时间，被系统自动终止了。 --- **可能的原因：** 1. **任务卡住了** — 网络请求没响应、死锁、或者等待某个资源 2. **任务太重了** — 需要处理的数据太多，正常执行时间超过了阈值 3. **外部依赖挂了** — 依赖的服务/接口响应很慢或超时 --- **你可以检查：** ```bash # 查看最近的 cron 日志 openclaw logs --cron # 或者直接看系统日志 openc\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5296f4d320a